<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CompuServe started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CompuServe started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities said it started coverage of CompuServe Inc with a near-term rating of market perform.</p>
<p>-- Also started long-term rating at market perform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 11.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
